      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（好像我总是在被给予……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a3ef255650c1689e528739f771ce3436d48916562de9346fb71c45f91046f6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9d12684fe77a5de02be7d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏她提前布置好训练员室，我的心情变得明朗了许多。\n或许正因如此，我工作也很顺利。不过――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a912f323e848fd4676ad4ee7f34db6b11fd4862c380bc3676ecbe9c3e596a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c7dff5da8ee9566aa150f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然最后圆满解决了，但遇到这样的事，即便是她也会感到\n郁闷吧。我本是这么想的……但实际上好像不是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2607d781dcc1e64018db3bb9f6e2236ca294c6cd61c61f26f8c3efdbcda715f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1c65bdd9d973e6c46b15fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ec3d6962b18491d965d207",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼ー，搞砸啦ー！　多亏了有训练员我才得救了！\n果然，风水在小孩子看来有点可怕吧ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a39babf68c4ce4200b2168efb1508367f8d4b6df09577b03082a90939b878ae5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8502ec8cfee4a4638069bcf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56d1bde6272c3ac17dec7e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟那个女孩子说明的时候，讲话再冷静一点就更好了。\n我偶尔会被说『历奇的压迫感太强了』之类的。唔ー，反省！",
      "source_fingerprint": "901b6cb2743fd2acfd609f41b6b55c842f946f1efd0cdea292781e922b6f1f4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0044b71d59971db4a0d8f0b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你还好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f583b2d021f11bd05f92319bde7dddf9afb18109e1b99fff437e4c36fdab750",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae05b2f510638e8e6d56399",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她跟往常一样健谈。还迅速地进行了反省以及调整了\n自己的心态……不过我觉得她的表情有些僵硬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "483e279f9ff5ca9d266f2e3fc5cbb1161a2c2e93e636d94d10300625ed1c736f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:febdd6c99012f0133d8fe2e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是说这个",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d3839abe4ca419badfe604fa63951ca3c44043127c9764f3c07b5b69b32f09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7e66d95e4f18eb81b34f2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de21a6fb6ddf61841e36cbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶？　嗯！　当然。\n我会努力不犯相同的错误，也会针对心乱采取对策哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "048f206e8883380b6bd919fecbbfb1c8ad1357d9af191fada5e5e873c6753c71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299e6bf546383fb7540e35c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我知道小林历奇可以通过风水提高情绪。\n制定今后的计划、实践、防止气的混乱，都是她的强项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1a7c8b6c1fb2bfba9b989631d1fc810ce1d2ebdc78299f202378a15916b990",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc05326b64bb1fe5a0738d09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以她现在也是在试图掩盖自己的负面情绪。\n有种很努力在掩盖的感觉――我这样告诉她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66e64a3d49ec9308f93954ab03d25d588cef2d21de457c64b6bffdb1dbe7108",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f40e99936163ccf2cd5a81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
