        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb4b7bcce68d5df0409edc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总是想着『用风水解决吧』。而对于自己的心情……\n尤其是负面的心情，有不去直面的习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c432b672bd97bff084299f1721cddaf0aec0af049501e697bfeb280e33140bac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577f9f12e8b7999e3b77c34a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来，训练员的职责就是扶持自己的签约赛马娘。\n我开始天天思考，有没有什么可以回报她的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca21f3f7bf48e859c85bb1ce217e03d3306423130bfbca25c7c039e05aca176b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
